residency (measurements): not measured — no dev store; use check --residency --fixture <fixture-directory> --as <principal>
  query chats:
    scan members.byPrincipalRoom first 20 — rule decided by the prefix: no probes
      sort/group/sum/count consume this page, not the whole population
  query searchBatch:
    merge messages: up to 20 lanes; each matching scope merges at most 32 first-term words, further terms filter; past 32 words a lane is incomplete (word_cut_at names it), later lanes continue; meter ceilings remain query-wide
    scan members.byPrincipalRoom first 20 — rule decided by the prefix: no probes
      sort/group/sum/count consume this page, not the whole population
    scan messages.byRoomWords first 20 — rule uniform over the prefix: one verdict
      sort/group/sum/count consume this page, not the whole population
  query following:
    merge posts: up to 2048 lanes
    scan follows.byPair first 2048 — rule decided by the prefix: no probes
      sort/group/sum/count consume this page, not the whole population
    scan posts.byAuthorTime first 20 — rule decided by the prefix: no probes
      sort/group/sum/count consume this page, not the whole population
  query roster:
    point members.byRoomPrincipal — one row, one rule check
    scan members.byRoomPrincipal first 20 — rule uniform over the prefix: one verdict
      sort/group/sum/count consume this page, not the whole population
  query unread:
    scan members.byPrincipalRoom first 2048 — rule decided by the prefix: no probes
      sort/group/sum/count consume this page, not the whole population
    point messageCounts.byGroup — one row, one rule check
  query trending:
    scan posts.byRank first 10 — rule decided by the prefix: no probes
      sort/group/sum/count consume this page, not the whole population
      filter over ≤ examined ceiling (8192)
  mutation post:
    no explicit reads
    insert posts
  mutation like:
    point posts.byKey — one row, one rule check
    point likes.byPostPrincipal — one row, one rule check
    point likes.byPostPrincipal — one row, one rule check
    point likeCounts.byGroup — one row, one rule check
    write target posts.byId — engine-private lookup; the update rule decides
    insert likes
    delete likes
    update posts
  mutation seedMessages:
    range: steps ≤ meter
    no explicit reads
    insert messages
  mutation seedMembers:
    range: steps ≤ meter
    no explicit reads
    insert members
  mutation seedFollows:
    range: steps ≤ meter
    no explicit reads
    insert follows
  mutation seedPosts:
    range: steps ≤ meter
    no explicit reads
    insert posts
  mutation seedLikes:
    range: steps ≤ meter
    point posts.byKey — one row, one rule check
    point likes.byPostPrincipal — one row, one rule check
    point likes.byPostPrincipal — one row, one rule check
    point likeCounts.byGroup — one row, one rule check
    write target posts.byId — engine-private lookup; the update rule decides
    insert likes
    delete likes
    update posts

